{"4657730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grandpa Needs Fish", "steam_appid": 4657730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/8600a633b6ea7262e8514ec5f5cc50b7.avif?t=1786374853\" width=741 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Grandpa Needs Fish</strong> is a cozy idle clicker adventure where fortune rides the waves. After Grandpa announces that the Great Migration has begun, Abraham sets off to catch as many fish as possible and turn the family's luck around. Hover, catch, upgrade, and grow your fishing empire in this satisfying idle, incremental game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/3f06e6660909d129748f9d13a4f6fb4a.poster.avif?t=1786374853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/3f06e6660909d129748f9d13a4f6fb4a.webm?t=1786374853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/3f06e6660909d129748f9d13a4f6fb4a.mp4?t=1786374853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/e9fe8b9adf999451346886d69adc532b.avif?t=1786374853\" width=896 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Automate</strong> your fishing empire by calling your childhood friend Debra, a LEGENDARY angler and the coolest boat rider on the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/0a0f055015dc687ccd8356cfa8fd1828.poster.avif?t=1786374853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/0a0f055015dc687ccd8356cfa8fd1828.webm?t=1786374853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/0a0f055015dc687ccd8356cfa8fd1828.mp4?t=1786374853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/9867e72f3ae51c16dbcd93894bdd6469.avif?t=1786374853\" width=896 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Summon Pedro the Croc 🐊</strong> to boost your haul. He appears and just snaps up every fish within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/2d7bb7e251ca59068c582c550f24d0ce.poster.avif?t=1786374853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/2d7bb7e251ca59068c582c550f24d0ce.webm?t=1786374853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/2d7bb7e251ca59068c582c550f24d0ce.mp4?t=1786374853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/1ebd965941eeb0496fc123fa7f7116a3.avif?t=1786374853\" width=896 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover and collect</strong> 85+ unique fish in your ever-growing Journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/e0b9bfe96c6ae981a2d5bc34b362f6f7.poster.avif?t=1786374853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/e0b9bfe96c6ae981a2d5bc34b362f6f7.webm?t=1786374853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/e0b9bfe96c6ae981a2d5bc34b362f6f7.mp4?t=1786374853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please consider wishlisting the game to support it. If you’d like to follow the development progress and see behind-the-scenes content, you can check it out on YouTube  or join the Discord to get updates before anyone else.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/8600a633b6ea7262e8514ec5f5cc50b7.avif?t=1786374853\" width=741 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Grandpa Needs Fish</strong> is a cozy idle clicker adventure where fortune rides the waves. After Grandpa announces that the Great Migration has begun, Abraham sets off to catch as many fish as possible and turn the family's luck around. Hover, catch, upgrade, and grow your fishing empire in this satisfying idle, incremental game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657730/extras/3f06e6660909d129